# Baked plant prototypes: derived data, rebuilt by the "Bake prototypes" button
# on any PlantProfile. Deterministic from (profile, grammar, seed), and
# expensive to store here because this project serializes assets as TEXT --
# 8 variants x 3 LODs of one tree is ~12 MB of YAML.
